        {
          "id": 1636708545,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "To avoid the need for updating the copyright year.",
          "author": {
            "id": 4753670,
            "username": "stigbjorlykke",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/905aafc6b50e246885f5ea9273a9dc4f22e2658b71f9a1b551b797082bec3f80?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/stigbjorlykke"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-11-07T08:41:54.558Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-11-07T08:41:54.558Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 199381371,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 9468,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1636723821,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "That is legal requirement. One MUST say all the years that the code was modified in. Like 1998, 2003, 2005-2023. You probably cannot mention years the code was not modified in or older years if the old code is gone. And certainly you cannot assume that the year can be 1998-2999. At each commit a different copyright applies, IT EXPIRES and enters public domain after death in 70 + probably 28 years.\n\nhttps://www.quora.com/Will-GPL-licensed-software-enter-the-public-domain-when-their-copyright-expires/\n\nIt does not appear you do a corporation assignment, but\n\n>For works that are created by corporations on or after January 1, 1978, the term of copyright protection lasts for either 95 years from publication or 120 years from creation, whichever is shorter.",
          "author": {
            "id": 4334216,
            "username": "ValZapod",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Valerii Zapod.",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8cbd6d8ace62b0f9ddde773e6b7b781f0179e7b0a397aad45f4386db6d4dffbc?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/ValZapod"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-11-07T08:52:12.349Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-11-07T09:17:08.027Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 199381371,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
